==Esperanto==

===Etymology===
{{m|eo|ki-|pos=interrogative and relative [[:Category:Esperanto correlatives|correlative]] prefix}} + {{m|eo|-e|pos=correlative suffix of place}}

===Pronunciation===
{{eo-IPA|a=Eo-kie.ogg}}

===Conjunction===
{{head|eo|conjunction|cat2=correlatives|accusative|kien}}

# [[where]]
#: {{ux|eo|Tie li trovis post unuhora promenado kaj pridemandado la ponton, '''kie''' li trovos sian feliĉon.|There he found, after one hour of walking and interrogating, the bridge, where he would find his happiness.}}

===Adverb===
{{head|eo|adverb|cat2=correlatives|accusative|kien}}

# [[where]]

====Derived terms====
* {{l|eo|kie ajn|gloss=[[wherever]]}}

===Usage notes===
Like other interrogative and relative correlatives, '''kie''' can be combined with ''[[ajn]]'', the adverbial particle of generality. '''''Kie''' ajn'' thus means ''[[wherever]]''.

